{"title":"Briarling","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 43 Briar that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/briarling\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briarling?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>97</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briarling?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>124</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/briarling?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>97</td><td>in the wilds around 1694, 1561</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/briarling?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>124</td><td>in the wilds around 1659, 1581</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 15 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wild-rose-hip\" title=\"Wild Rose Hip - in 13 of 15 looted corpses, 13 recorded drops, 20 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/97ed0af0ce528f53d233.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wild Rose Hip</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-cutting\" title=\"Thorn Cutting - in 9 of 15 looted corpses, 9 recorded drops, 11 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/32fe2a6f1fb8885c9afb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Cutting</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"briarwood\" title=\"Briarwood - in 7 of 15 looted corpses, 7 recorded drops, 12 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/5a164111773bd319e75c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Briarwood</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 1 of 15 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 1 of 15 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/15<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-89.1px,-1116.3px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:101.8px;top:1131.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:118.9px;top:1130.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:-0.6px;top:1067.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:93.6px;top:1128.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:121.6px;top:1141.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:83.9px;top:1125.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:112.0px;top:1120.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:100.4px;top:1116.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:132.7px;top:1136.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:151.2px;top:1143.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:82.5px;top:1119.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:120.3px;top:1124.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:74.9px;top:1102.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:75.2px;top:1123.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:110.0px;top:1140.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:48.8px;top:1109.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:136.1px;top:1154.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:54.3px;top:1115.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:20.6px;top:1095.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:32.2px;top:1094.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:28.9px;top:1102.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:166.3px;top:1165.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:125.8px;top:1135.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:105.2px;top:1135.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:148.1px;top:1145.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:101.1px;top:1121.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:90.7px;top:1132.6px\"><